            <font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="3">
<p class=MsoNormal>This guide will help you be successful at making platinum and getting your character geared up!  It is not a get rich quick plan.  <i><b>I present proven techniques that I have used to make millions of PP.</i></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Within a few days your level one character can go from having no PP at all...to having several thousand PP.  Or if you are a more experienced player, I can show you how to maximize your PP to make millions!</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><u>It takes some time...there is no method that does not require you to put some effort into it.</u>  But you will be successful if you follow my plan.  It works!</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>As a Cleric on my server, I rarely was able to loot.  By the time the fight was over I still had to finish healing the tank...of course, by then someone else had looted.  Even with looting in normal groups it can be hard to get enough platinum to buy the uber gear you want for your character.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>I teach someone who is new to the game how to generate invesment PP and then how to maximize the bazaar to buy and sell items.  I have made millions of plat doing this, and I have found it to be more profitable than any of the other techniques I have seen (farming, trade skills, high end guild farming, etc).</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>My guide will give you proven techniques that have worked for me to get you the Platinum you need!</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b>In addition, I am willing to answer any questions you may have after reading the guide!</b>  Feel free to ask for clarification or specifics about any of the information I present.  Or if you have any recommendations for how I can improve the guide, please feel free to let me know...</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Once the transaction has been competed via Paypal, I will e-mail you the guide as a Word Document (if you need it in a different format, please just let me know).</p>
</font>

